<title>USA: Eastern Co buys back shares.</title>
<headline>Eastern Co buys back shares.</headline>
<dateline>NAUGATUCK, Conn. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Eastern Co said that it has purchased a block of 99,900 shares, or slightly less than 4 percent, of its own common stock at market price.</p>
<p>The company has 2.61 million shares outstanding after this repurchase, a company spokesman said.</p>
<p>During the first seven months of 1997, Eastern has repurchased 178,000 shares of stock, the company said.</p>
